609
00:36:08.938 --> 00:36:10.438
Il y a MMM. Il y a MMM.

610
00:36:13.948 --> 00:36:15.946
Dori m’a aidé.

611
00:36:15.947 --> 00:36:17.603
Dori a fait ?

612
00:36:17.604 --> 00:36:19.051
